body:
for those who love mold ( and for those who tolerate the mold lovers )

...but seriously, this is a mod made to introduce all the for-fun made models and additions by creator, forgottenjohn. as of right now, it only introduces simple models to be placed in item frames for silly decorations about your minecraft world, but expect for wild things going forward!! 

to see the current state of the mod and what has been introduced, make sure to check the changelog!
